"+-----------------+------------+\n"
"\n"
".. list-table::\n"
"   :header-rows: 1\n"
"\n"
"   - * Purpose\n"
"     * Table Type\n"
"   - * listing shortcuts\n"
"     * simple table\n"
"   - * lots of colspans\n"
"     * grid table\n"
